            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>An atomizer (100) is provided. The atomizer (100) includes a housing (1), including an accommodating cavity (11) and an air outlet channel (12); an atomization base (2), disposed in the accommodating cavity (11); and an atomization core (3), disposed on the atomization base (2). The atomization base (2) is engaged with the housing (1) to form a liquid storage cavity (10). The atomization core (3) includes an atomization surface (31). The atomization base (2) includes a first side wall (21), the first side wall (21) is a planar structure, a mounting hole (211) is defined on the first side wall (21), and the atomization core (3) is disposed in the mounting hole (211). An angle between the atomization surface (31) and an axial direction (A1) of the atomizer (100) is less than 30 degrees.</p>
            </abstract>
